==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|bi|lateral|lang=en}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Having two [[side]]s
# Involving both sides [[equally]].
# {{label|en|of an [[agreement]]}} [[binding|Binding]] on both of the two [[parties]] involved.
# Having [[bilateral symmetry]].
# {{label|en|anthropology}} Involving descent or ascent regardless of sex and side of the family.

